Package: ecodata
Title: Traceable Ecological Data Processing Foundation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Martina", "Pulieri", email = "martina.pulieri@unisalento.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Registers immutable ecological input files, preserves explicit parser
    and schema configuration revisions, and records processing history in SQLite.
    Defines versioned validation rules, mapping declarations and typed result
    contracts. Executes exact identifier linkage checks and compares candidate
    key scopes while preserving source values.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: DBI, RSQLite, digest, jsonlite, xml2, stats, utils, tools,
    shiny, bslib
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2, pkgload, renv, zip, withr, parallel
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
